 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/433eb68f3dffb0e026c229c2e315f42d.webm?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/433eb68f3dffb0e026c229c2e315f42d.mp4?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cJobs\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six unique jobs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Fighter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A melee job that wields a sword and shield.<br>With balanced attack and defense, it\u2019s easy to handle.<br>Switch between standard attacks and counters to control the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/9c4133186c0adc984c3b4a432a0e3acf.poster.avif?t=1743735622\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/9c4133186c0adc984c3b4a432a0e3acf.webm?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/9c4133186c0adc984c3b4a432a0e3acf.mp4?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Ranger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-range job that uses a bow.<br>Low defense, but exceptional range!<br>Take advantage of distance to attack freely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/3467888d8cecf1753206395c1751708f.poster.avif?t=1743735622\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/3467888d8cecf1753206395c1751708f.webm?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/3467888d8cecf1753206395c1751708f.mp4?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Sorcerer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-range job that wields a staff.<br>Like the Ranger, it has low defense, but can cast powerful magic.<br>Charge your magic to alter its effects!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/518726bbd38d98fe6586ad3e96db19e2.poster.avif?t=1743735622\" width=390 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/518726bbd38d98fe6586ad3e96db19e2.webm?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/518726bbd38d98fe6586ad3e96db19e2.mp4?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Monk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A melee job that fights with fists and dual daggers.<br>Lower attack and defense, with short range, but excellent mobility.<br>Dodge enemy attacks and strike relentlessly as an infighter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/33906bf91b1a77f976780e1494e252ab.poster.avif?t=1743735622\" width=404 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/33906bf91b1a77f976780e1494e252ab.webm?t=1743735622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621980/extras/33906